.TH "pipewire-filter-chain.conf" 5 "1.6.8" "PipeWire" \" -*- nroff -*-
.ad l
.nh
.SH "نام (NAME)"
pipewire-filter-chain.conf \- filter-chain\&.conf 
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.PP
PipeWire example configuration for running audio filters\&.

.PP
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.PP

.PP
\fI$XDG_CONFIG_HOME/pipewire/filter-chain\&.conf\fP

.PP
\fI/etc/pipewire/filter-chain\&.conf\fP

.PP
\fI/usr/share/pipewire/filter-chain\&.conf\fP

.PP
\fI/usr/share/pipewire/filter-chain\&.conf\&.d/\fP

.PP
\fI/etc/pipewire/filter-chain\&.conf\&.d/\fP

.PP
\fI$XDG_CONFIG_HOME/pipewire/filter-chain\&.conf\&.d/\fP

.PP
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.PP

.PP
When \fBpipewire(1)\fP is run using this configuration file, \fRpipewire -c filter-chain\&.conf\fP, it starts a PipeWire client application that publishes nodes that apply various audio filters to their input\&.

.PP
It is a normal PipeWire client application in all respects\&.

.PP
Drop-in configuration files \fRfilter-chain\&.conf\&.d/*\&.conf\fP can be used to modify the filter configuration, see \fBpipewire\&.conf(5)\fP\&. Some examples are in \fI/usr/share/pipewire/filter-chain/\fP

.PP
.SH "نویسندگان (AUTHORS)"
.PP

.PP
The PipeWire Developers <https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/pipewire/pipewire/issues>; PipeWire is available from <https://pipewire.org>

.PP
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.PP

.PP
\fBpipewire(1)\fP, \fBpipewire\&.conf(5)\fP 

